From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mpv-ht <mpv-ht@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:25:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] libaribcaption: compile its namespaced MD5 implementation

Upstream 6c3b4f3 renamed its MD5 functions to aribcc_md5_* and removed the
OpenSSL substitution from md5.h. The old HAVE_OPENSSL override still excludes
md5.c, leaving the three new functions undefined when linking libmpv.
Stop defining that legacy override so the bundled implementation is compiled.
---
 packages/libaribcaption.cmake | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/libaribcaption.cmake b/packages/libaribcaption.cmake
--- a/packages/libaribcaption.cmake
+++ b/packages/libaribcaption.cmake
@@ -20,8 +20,6 @@ ExternalProject_Add(libaribcaption
         -DARIBCC_NO_RTTI=ON
         -DARIBCC_USE_FONTCONFIG=ON
         -DARIBCC_USE_FREETYPE=ON
-        "-DCMAKE_C_FLAGS='-DHAVE_OPENSSL=1'"
-        "-DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS='-DHAVE_OPENSSL=1'"
     BUILD_COMMAND ${EXEC} ninja -C <BINARY_DIR>
     INSTALL_COMMAND ${EXEC} ninja -C <BINARY_DIR> install
     LOG_DOWNLOAD 1 LOG_UPDATE 1 LOG_CONFIGURE 1 LOG_BUILD 1 LOG_INSTALL 1
-- 
